              knowledge: r3`\(\dfrac{A}{B} : \dfrac{C}{D} = \dfrac{A}{B}\cdot\dfrac{D}{C}\); phân thức nghịch đảo.`,
              signs: "Th\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EE7a hai ph\xE2n th\u1EE9c; t\xECm ph\xE2n th\u1EE9c ngh\u1ECBch \u0111\u1EA3o.",
