        fc("\u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng cao tam gi\xE1c \u0111\u1EC1u", r4`h = \dfrac{a\sqrt3}{2}`, r4`- \(a\): cạnh tam giác đều`, r4`\(a = 6\): \(h = 3\sqrt3 \approx 5{,}2\).`)
